Criterion 7: no test in test/core/network/ makes a live network call.

A test can only reach a socket if some Dio in it keeps the default
HttpClientAdapter. Two greps below: every AuthInterceptor built in a
test injects retryDioFactory (so the 401 replay client is fake), and
every Dio those tests create has httpClientAdapter reassigned to a
fake transport.

